      "text": "\n界面实现模块\n\n适配系统：\n    1. 浏览器界面\n    2. 安卓手机\n    3. 苹果手机\n    4. 鸿蒙手机",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "_MCmEW8J1jgjFT-prf22U",
      "originalText": "\n界面实现模块\n\n适配系统：\n    1. 浏览器界面\n    2. 安卓手机\n    3. 苹果手机\n    4. 鸿蒙手机",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "B7JzkZyBqZG9I5k4r38q1",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 7508.272648980005,
      "y": 82.57809467619086,
      "width": 2095.333333333333,
      "height": 1661.3333333333337,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
